# Charmed Sleep {1}{U}{U}: "Enchant creature. When this Aura enters, tap enchanted creature. Enchanted creature doesn't untap
# during its controller's untap step." Bot1 enchants Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 3: it is tapped as the Aura enters (the trigger
# resolves), is still tapped after Bot2's turn-4 untap step, and untaps in the turn-6 untap step once Bot2 Disenchants the Aura
# on turn 4 (CR 502.3: the ban lasts only while the Aura is attached).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Charmed Sleep
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Pearl
Disenchant
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Charmed Sleep.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Disenchant.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Charmed Sleep)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
[T6 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Charmed Sleep
